
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>My Personal Portfolio</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
</head>
<body>

    <header>
        <h2>My Portfolio</h2>
        <nav>
            <a href="#home">Home</a>
            <a href="#about">About</a>
            <a href="#projects">Projects</a>
            <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
        </nav>
    </header>

    <section id="home" class="hero">
        <h1>Hello, I am Keshav</h1>
        <p>Student | Web Development Learner</p>
        <a href="#projects" class="btn">View My Projects</a>
    </section>

    <section id="about">
        <h2>About Me</h2>
        <p>
            I am a student interested in programming and web development.
            I enjoy learning HTML, CSS and Python and creating simple projects.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section id="projects">
        <h2>My Projects</h2>
        <div class="project">
            <h3>Project 1: Personal Portfolio</h3>
            <p>A personal website created using HTML and CSS.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="project">
            <h3>Project 2: Python Programs</h3>
            <p>Simple Python programs using loops and conditions.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="project">
            <h3>Project 3: GitHub Website</h3>
            <p>A static website published using GitHub Pages.</p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section id="contact">
        <h2>Contact Me</h2>
        <form action="#" method="post">
            <input type="text" placeholder="Your Name" required>
            <input type="email" placeholder="Your Email" required>
            <textarea placeholder="Your Message" rows="5" required></textarea>
            <button type="submit">Send Message</button>
        </form>
        <p class="note">
            Note: This is a demo form. It does not send messages without a
            backend or form service.
        </p>
    </section>

    <footer>
        <p>© 2026 Keshav | My Personal Portfolio</p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
